OL,3,GNEWSARescuers called in over
OL,4,A'suspicious item' in crevice
OL,5,
OL,6,FMountain rescuers were sent by police
OL,7,Fto investigate a suspicious item in the
OL,8,FPeak District - only to discover dumped
OL,9,Fcamping kit.
OL,11,FA member of the public walking near
OL,12,FKinder Scout raised the alarm over a
OL,13,F"large suspicious item" at the bottom
OL,14,Fof a crevice near the Crowden Tower
OL,15,Foutcrop at about 10:00 BST on Saturday.
OL,17,FKinder Mountain Rescue Team said
OL,18,FDerbyshire Police requested its
OL,19,Fassistance and a six-volunteer hill
OL,20,Fparty was sent to investigate.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
