OL,3,GNEWSARescuers called in over
OL,4,A'suspicious item' in crevice
OL,5,
OL,6,FUsing a 15m extendable reach pole and
OL,7,Fhook usually deployed for water
OL,8,Frescues, the team recovered three black
OL,9,Fbin bags.
